<article class="env-lemma" id="07J0">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/07J0">Lemma <span data-tag="07J0">60.12.4</span>.</a> In Situation <a href="/tag/07MF" data-tag="07MF">60.7.5</a>. For any affine object $(U, T, \delta )$ of $\text{Cris}(X/S)$ mapping into an affine open $V \subset S$ we have </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \Gamma ((U, T, \delta ), \Omega _{X/S}) = \Omega _{\Gamma (T, \mathcal{O}_ T)/\Gamma (V, \mathcal{O}_ V), \delta }  \]
</div>
  <p> where the right hand side is as constructed in Section <a href="/tag/07HQ" data-tag="07HQ">60.6</a>. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Combine Lemmas <a href="/tag/07IY" data-tag="07IY">60.12.2</a> and <a href="/tag/07IZ" data-tag="07IZ">60.12.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>